docs/guide.md:78:### Planner: natural language → Story + plan
docs/guide.md:80:`lattice planner ...` is the Proofbound-native planner entry point: it turns a one-sentence natural-language requirement into a Proofbound Story draft, checklist, verification intent, and typed `plannedSteps[]` for the autopilot executor to consume. It never hands Story / job / receipt authority to an external framework.
