docs/guide.md:106:lattice story resolve --storyId=<story> --json
docs/guide.md:111:- `autopilot review submit/status` records local verifier verdicts keyed by `storyId` / `runId`.
docs/guide.md:112:- `quorum_submit` bulk-records local 3x2 quorum evidence only after current reviewer pass evidence exists for every required review lane.
